{"name": "Phoenix's Faye", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a game that I developed alone using Unreal. The story background:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A young woman trained in martial arts since childhood, she masters swordsmanship, archery, and formidable hand-to-hand combat! For some unknown reason, she finds herself trapped in a fantastical world. To return home, she must fight endlessly. This fantastical world features diverse regions, each with its own unique style\u2014wuxia, xianxia, dark fantasy, etc. She battles different enemies across these varied lands, embracing the thrill of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/6262a7036a0699fcefdf0091bd0c1978.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/2b2ba9a5f0057ef4103cd019e498a6f9.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Clothing Destruction System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/75d9905af826ae4ab212622a7bba9aae.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/75d9905af826ae4ab212622a7bba9aae.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/75d9905af826ae4ab212622a7bba9aae.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New \"All Thumbs\" Difficulty (Easy Mode)!</strong><br/>You can enable Easy Mode in the options, and switch difficulties anytime during gameplay. Don't worry\u2014enemies won't become dumb in Easy Mode, but players can regain large amounts of health by performing stylish moves like parries and perfect dodges. Additionally, the special meter fills up more easily, allowing you to unleash powerful moves anytime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are parries and perfect dodges hard to execute?</strong><br/>This might be the easiest action game to pull off parries and perfect dodges! The game's mechanics are quite lenient, so players can stylishly dodge and parry to their heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2018Swords &amp; Shadows\u2019 Level Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The heroine faces relentless group battles\u2014swordsmen, shield bearers, archersk, a true swarm combat experience. No polite duels here\uff0cenemies rush in all at once, no holds barred!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch combat styles on the fly: Wield a tachi, switch to arrows, or go bare-handed\uff0cadapt to any threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tachi mastery against crowds:\u00a0Parry to deflect attackers, perfect dodge to counter \u2014 each slash carves a gleaming arc through foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unarmed? No problem! In this world, martial arts unleash \"Mountain-Splitting Strikes\" and \"Heart-Piercing Kicks\" \u2014 sending enemies flying in waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget health packs\u2014style equals survival:\u00a0Regain HP by nailing parries, dodges, etc.\u00a0Build the Rage Gauge(Fire), when full, unleash a screen-clearing ultimate attack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>There are more levels waiting for you to challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3a42c40fb75b54107577a83435a1fd7e.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3a42c40fb75b54107577a83435a1fd7e.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3a42c40fb75b54107577a83435a1fd7e.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/70dcf5fae8081c65fb8fcff44968f1bd.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/70dcf5fae8081c65fb8fcff44968f1bd.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/70dcf5fae8081c65fb8fcff44968f1bd.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31334f214668f0446b0a8028ebfe76a4.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31334f214668f0446b0a8028ebfe76a4.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31334f214668f0446b0a8028ebfe76a4.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Miss Sparrow is a legendary figure in this fantasy world, and you can control her to complete her exclusive levels!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3fbe8a87ecae9a10c161840a0c439116.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/60cdfba6ab59a4f37281de3756af48dc.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QQ Group:</strong>\u00a0979195753</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you are interested in this game and game development, Please subscribe my youtube: @VeryBigFireball</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A girl who has practiced martial arts since childhood finds herself, for some unknown reason, trapped in a fantastical world. She must continuously fight to find her way back home! This is a high-difficulty action game featuring intense combat, immersive scene atmospheres, highly oppressive NPCs.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/2c66eccc1b7f24be95a872dec74e5a5aa55368c6/header.jpg?t=1784557125", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Sexual Content", "Female Protagonist", "Nudity", "Hack and Slash", "Action", "Archery"], "developers": "BigFireball", "publishers": "BigFireball", "release_date": "Nov 4, 2025", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "3521270", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "30 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/7v5_fYXfbr4", "first_seen": 1748563200.0, "review_rank": 1622}